{"parentUuid":"020c11d8-93a7-44cc-a031-6f840658575a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEegbhbcrLE9L3qHLPS4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#267 is fixed and no longer conflicts. I rebased it onto `main` and kept both tests in the shared file, yours from #266 and this PR's. The result is signed and shows verified on GitHub, and the 20 tests in that file pass. GitHub reports it mergeable, with CI still running (\"unstable\" means checks are pending).\n\nThe other 15 PRs are merged.\n\n**What's next**\n\n1. **Release PR #248 and the Release run on `main`.** A Release run is in progress from your merges. Let it finish and merge #248 when you want to ship. I haven't touched it.\n2. **Plan upkeep.** I'll drop the shipped items from `NEXT-WORK.md` and remove the stale worktrees and branches (`stack-*`, `maturin-defer` and the rest). This is local only. Say if you want it.\n3. **Work I can start without your input:**\n   - T06 PR 2: reject the colon form of references (E316).\n   - T06 PRs 3 to 5: canonical-required config, command-line arguments, and emitted ids.\n   - A CI job for the declared MSRV, plus a scheduled `cargo deny` run and Cargo dependabot.\n   - Semver checks in CI.\n   - Fuzz targets for the manifest editors.\n4. **Decisions only you can make:**\n   - OIDC trusted publishing, which needs a policy exception for `id-token`.\n   - Which crates go to 1.0.\n   - Pre-release mode on the managed route.\n   - Snapshot publishing and dist-tag policy.\n   - The schema version bump for T06.\n   - Whether the first release run needs the foreign-version and wrong-commit tagging decisions.\n\nI'd do item 2 now and start T06 PR 2 next, since the remaining T06 work builds on it. Which do you want?\n\nresult: PR #267's conflict is resolved (rebased on `main`, signed, verified, tests pass, now mergeable); the other 15 PRs are merged, and I've proposed plan cleanup and T06 PR 2 as the next work."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":116568,"output_tokens":677,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":116568,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":250},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"094d7a22-dafd-4fc6-aee0-92bf5febc9ca","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEegbREt1ihoEPGtvasP","type":"assistant","uuid":"d1c6a32d-4fca-4c04-9ee9-39f1017ecb30","timestamp":"2026-10-21T03:11:51.541Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/stack-unknown","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"stack/docs-v1","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
