{"parentUuid":"e9f242c5-9b21-4f8d-8bda-7ee90d49f89c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"26ff9d9b-c388-4173-9aa2-ff76b9634f6a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018VgZvAEYzBVWvbb2UCyNJW","type":"tool_result","content":"145:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-11\",\n150:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-08\",\n155:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-09\",\n143-    },\n144-    {\n145:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-11\",\n146-      \"criterion\": \"A package that uses the default tag template takes a `{name}@{version}` tag as its release only if the tag's commit did not hold a manifest of another ecosystem under that name\n147-      \"is_error_case\": false\n148-    },\n149-    {\n150-      \"id\": \"WS-ID-08\",\n151-      \"criterion\": \"A package whose explicit `tag-template` equals another package's default tag template makes `status` and `version` fail with E101 naming both packages and the template.\",\n| E249 | Two different groups both list the same member | List the member in only one group; remove it from all but one.\n| E250 | One group lists the same member more than once | Remove the duplicate member from the group's member list. |\n| E251 | Group has no members | Add at least one member to the group, or remove the group. |\n\n\n240 numeric E#### codes total in one registry.\nbrave-badgers-run.md  251B\nbrave-stags-hunt.md  337B\ncalm-owls-claim.md  247B\n---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nA `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` that lists one package under two of its names, such as a Cargo crate and its npm name in a dual package, is now rejected with E250 instead of being accepted silently.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"66f2c610-e901-4131-9ed6-56a8dd544b02","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:35:49.380Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"145:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-11\",\n150:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-08\",\n155:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-09\",\n143-    },\n144-    {\n145:      \"id\": \"WS-ID-11\",\n146-      \"criterion\": \"A package that uses the default tag template takes a `{name}@{version}` tag as its release only if the tag's commit did not hold a manifest of another ecosystem under that name\n147-      \"is_error_case\": false\n148-    },\n149-    {\n150-      \"id\": \"WS-ID-08\",\n151-      \"criterion\": \"A package whose explicit `tag-template` equals another package's default tag template makes `status` and `version` fail with E101 naming both packages and the template.\",\n| E249 | Two different groups both list the same member | List the member in only one group; remove it from all but one.\n| E250 | One group lists the same member more than once | Remove the duplicate member from the group's member list. |\n| E251 | Group has no members | Add at least one member to the group, or remove the group. |\n\n\n240 numeric E#### codes total in one registry.\nbrave-badgers-run.md  251B\nbrave-stags-hunt.md  337B\ncalm-owls-claim.md  247B\n---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nA `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` that lists one package under two of its names, such as a Cargo crate and its npm name in a dual package, is now rejected with E250 instead of being accepted silently.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"69acadad-c47d-48d2-87d1-ee060ebab61f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-colon","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/t06-colon","branch":"fix/reject-colon-references","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":17,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"example/x","visibi